{"id":"681d4278bd359695","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-smullyan-beta-coding.md","title":"Finite-Sequence Coding by the Beta Function","display":"thm-smullyan-beta-coding — Finite-Sequence Coding by the Beta Function","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-smullyan-beta-coding","aliases":["92-thm-smullyan-beta-coding"],"display":"thm-smullyan-beta-coding — Finite-Sequence Coding by the Beta Function","source":"第 IV 章 pp. 47–48，Theorem B（PDF 64–65）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-beta-function]]","[[92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-smullyan-beta-coding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-smullyan-beta-coding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-smullyan-beta-coding — Finite-Sequence Coding by the Beta Function"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IV 章 pp. 47–48，Theorem B（PDF 64–65）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5c0fd5c6fd5532ff\" href=\"?note=5c0fd5c6fd5532ff\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-beta-function\">92-df-smullyan-beta-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0c7c8d1473c7d455\" href=\"?note=0c7c8d1473c7d455\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma\">92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a_0,\\ldots,a_n)\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}\">\\((a_0,\\ldots,a_n)\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_E\">\\(\\beta_E\\)</span> 为上游已定义的全函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}beta\\text{-}coding}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall(a_0,\\ldots,a_n)\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\;\n\\exists w\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall i\\leq n\\;(\\beta_E(w,i)=a_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}beta\\text{-}coding}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall(a_0,\\ldots,a_n)\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\;\n\\exists w\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall i\\leq n\\;(\\beta_E(w,i)=a_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将有限图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{(0,a_0),\\ldots,(n,a_n)\\}\">\\(\\{(0,a_0),\\ldots,(n,a_n)\\}\\)</span> 交给有限集引理得到 w。对每个固定 i≤n，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_E(i,a,w)\">\\(K_E(i,a,w)\\)</span> 的 a 恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i\">\\(a_i\\)</span>，所以取最小候选仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i\">\\(a_i\\)</span>。重复的数值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i\">\\(a_i\\)</span> 不妨碍输入索引不同。</p>\n<p>结论仅为存在编码，不给唯一编码。n=0 仍有一个数值可编码；空序列也可用空集编码，但不需要它来证明本定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-beta-function","status":"resolved","id":"5c0fd5c6fd5532ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-beta-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"0c7c8d1473c7d455","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(a_0,\\ldots,a_n)\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}beta\\text{-}coding}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall(a_0,\\ldots,a_n)\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\;\n\\exists w\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall i\\leq n\\;(\\beta_E(w,i)=a_i).","display":true},{"tex":"\\{(0,a_0),\\ldots,(n,a_n)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"K_E(i,a,w)","display":false},{"tex":"a_i","display":false},{"tex":"a_i","display":false},{"tex":"a_i","display":false}],"bytes":1235,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-beta-function]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-beta-coding]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse]] → [[92-cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-elimination]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-pa-semantic-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-307","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-beta-coding]]"}],"outgoing":["5c0fd5c6fd5532ff","0c7c8d1473c7d455"]}